<speak>I will cover the formal points here before we move back to the housekeeping. The transaction fee for this sale is 0.25% of the transaction amount. Please bear in mind that you may lose some or all of the capital you invested. Are you willing to accept an investment loss, including a loss realised when you sell? After that, we can give your folders and correspondence arrangements some attention. From what you have described, the practical difficulty is not a lack of care; it is that papers reach you through several different routes. A simpler routine might make the administrative side less tiring. We need not redesign your entire filing system on a telephone call, of course. Even deciding where an unopened personal envelope belongs could help keep it out of the general office pile.</speak>